    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Four-Bedroom Detached Home in a Peaceful Mayo Setting\n\nLooking for an affordable home in the countryside? This spacious four-bedroom detached residence in Kincon offers an impressive amount of accommodation, outdoor space and potential at a very attractive price point.\n\nThe property offers two reception rooms, four bedrooms including a generous master bedroom with en-suite, oil-fired central heating and a solid-fuel stove with back boiler. \n\nOutside, mature trees and generous grounds create a wonderfully private rural setting, while the property also benefits from a large, attached garage together with a traditional stone outbuilding/barn offering further possibilities.\n\nPriced to sell at 225,000, this is a property that offers a great deal for the money and is sure to appeal to buyers seeking space, countryside living and the opportunity to put their own stamp on a home.\n\nConveniently located approximately 7km from Killala, 13km from Crossmolina and 16km from Ballina, the property enjoys rural living while remaining within easy reach of surrounding towns and amenities.\n\n\nFeatures: \n\nDetached four-bedroom cottage\nTwo reception rooms\nLarge Master bedroom with spacious ensuite\nOil-fired central heating\nSolid fuel stove to back boiler\nBarn with endless possibilities \nLarge garage attached to cottage\nMature trees and generous outdoor space\nAmple off-street parking\nPeaceful countryside setting\n\nRequest your digital brochure\n"
      },
